<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h1 align="center" tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">LLM-I: LLMs are Naturally Interleaved Multimodal Creators</h1><a id="user-content-llm-i-llms-are-naturally-interleaved-multimodal-creators" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: LLM-I: LLMs are Naturally Interleaved Multimodal Creators" href="#llm-i-llms-are-naturally-interleaved-multimodal-creators"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h4 align="center" tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto"> Zirun Guo, Feng Zhang, Kai Jia, Tao Jin</h4><a id="user-content--zirun-guo-feng-zhang-kai-jia-tao-jin" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink:  Zirun Guo, Feng Zhang, Kai Jia, Tao Jin" href="#-zirun-guo-feng-zhang-kai-jia-tao-jin"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<div align="center" dir="auto">
<a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0" rel="nofollow"><img src="https://camo.githubusercontent.com/1e07db00d547cb8acb3caf3b24ddbb417ed0a2319a5633cf69b1528ba0f49f1e/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6963656e73652d417061636865253230322d626c7565" alt="license" data-canonical-src="https://img.shields.io/badge/license-Apache%202-blue" style="max-width: 100%;"></a>
